From e5210f1d3b26d33ff1b0b5ecc26ccd8cd79fc4be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lokesh B V <Lokesh.BV@Arm.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jul 2024 15:08:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] neoverse-rd/rdv3r1cfg1: add platform Support

RDV3R1-Cfg1 Platform configuration:
- 4 Chips
- 4 LCP (1:4 AP:LCP)
- 16 AP Cores
- CMN Cyprush Mesh: 3x4
  - 5 CCG Nodes
  - 2 SNF Nodes
- 2 IO Blocks : 1 for PCIe and 1 for Non-PCIe devices

+ Increased System cache backed region to accomodate remote chips
DRAM2 regions.

Signed-off-by: Lokesh B V <Lokesh.BV@Arm.com>
Change-Id: Id4f482bea51787689313e6bdce4aaeef0a3d4f91

Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
