+ *
+ * Cross chip CCG connections between the chips:
+ *
+ *  +------------------+        +------------------+
+ *  |       CCG2       |        |      CCG4        |
+ *  |              CCG3+--------+CCG3              |
+ *  |                  |        |                  |
+ *  |      CHIP 0      |        |      CHIP 2      |
+ *  |              CCG4+--+     |                  |
+ *  |                  |  |  +--+CCG2              |
+ *  |   CCG0    CCG1   |  |  |  |   CCG0    CCG1   |
+ *  +-----+------+-----+  |  |  +-----+------+-----+
+ *        |      |        |  |        |      |
+ *        |      |        |  |        |      |
+ *  +-----+------+-----+  |  |  +-----+------+-----+
+ *  |   CCG1    CCG0   |  |  |  |  CCG1    CCG0    |
+ *  |              CCG2|--|--+  |                  |
+ *  |                  |  +-----+CCG4              |
+ *  |      CHIP 1      |        |     CHIP 3       |
+ *  |                  |        |                  |
+ *  |              CCG3+--------+CCG3              |
+ *  |       CCG4       |        |      CCG2        |
+ *  +------------------+        +------------------+
+ *
+ */
